            "notes": "Threads of Fate\n\nIn my opinion, if you don\u2019t start with Threads of Fate, you start off wrong. This power is the best one hands down. You are immediately 50% more effective with both damage boost and healing for the first two rounds and that is more than ANY other power or item can give you. \n\nKEYNOTE FOR THREADS OF FATE !!! \n\nAlways remember to always switch between your team mates, if you are healing someone, switch to someone else to cap of them while also healing another team mate!\n\nCompensator - 5% Weapon Power, this is the best 1k item you can get.\n\nWeapon Grease - 5% Attack Speed, this is the second best 1k item you can get.\n\nFirst Aid Kit - 25 Shields + 33% time reduction on your self healing. This gives you an extra 25 regenerating shield and faster recovery for your support passive when you cannot heal with Sympathetic Recovery.\n\nI DO NOT Recommend:\n\nX Armored Vest - Despite it being armor rather than shields, it does not have the perk that First Aid does with the shorter heal reduction. I will always take First Aid  Armored Vest.\n\nX Running Shoes - This item is useless on spawn as you have GA to assist you, its only use is on respawns and returning you faster to your team. Its only value hinges on you dying. Don\u2019t get it.\n\nX Winning Attitude - This item\u2019s value hinges on you dying. It\u2019s not worth the ultimate charge.",
