            "notes": "Do NOT rush for a purple item. You will get more value with blue or green quality items. Build up your WP and AS with Talon Modification Module, Advanced Nanobiotics, or Aftermarket Firing Pin. I typically go for Talon Modification Module and Advanced Nanobiotics.\n\nAdvanced Nanobiotics is a preference for me as it gives you more WP along with the AS from healing, and when you're switching between targets often it'll always be affective. I'll only take Aftermarket Firing Pin if I'm a bit lower on cash.\n\nI DO NOT Recommend:\n\nX Icy Coolant (5,500) - 10% Weapon Power + 10% CD Reduction (This is a 10% Power item for far too much cash. It\u2019s not worth it.)\n\nX Mid-Air Mobilizer (4,000) - 5% Weapon Power + 10% Attack Speed while airborn. (You\u2019re not always getting value from this item, it encourages wasting GA and bad positioning.",
