            "notes": "I almost always take Triage Unit as it helps you farm Valkyrie and cash to ensure you get ahead of everyone else in the game. This insures that you can keep up with healing as the enemy team spikes in power.\n\nAmari\u2019s Antidote - Combined with Triage Unit, you get an insane amount of heals. Now you can farm out Valkyries, get a bunch of Stadium Cash, and continue pushing for blue beam while keeping up with healing.\n\nMake sure to GA before you heal past the critical mark on your team mates, as they get a bigger boost of healing through Triage Unit!\n\nI'd say that by this point, you'll know how your enemy team plays and will not need the extra survivability from First Aid Kit. Feel free to sell it, or keep it if you need to!",
