            "notes": "It\u2019s the best option no matter how much dirt you\u2019re eating in the match. This turns your fairly crappy Valkyrie into a pretty good Ultimate ability. With the items boosting your healing/damage beams, you should be farming out an Ultimate every team fight and this is when Crepuscular Circle comes into play. Make sure you keep your teammates in your line of sight so they get your affects - whip out the barbie blaster and give those pesky dps a taste of their own medicine. \n\nI'd typically take Eye of the Spider, which is still better than Hardlight accelerator. \n\nBy this point, think about how you are doing within this match and start building around it. A_Lords_Rose has an amazing chart on how to build around your performance which will be in the next round's notes!",
