            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-15T07:24:53.132792+00:00",
            "notes": "This build on the side is mostly built around the average player Mercy, but feel free to stray away from it depending on how you're doing! I will be putting the \"I'm getting wrecked\" and \"Glass Healer\" versions here, and the average player description in the next round's notes!\n\nOption 1: Help - I\u2019m Getting WRECKED!\n\nThis build offers strong heals (and in return, strong self heals) whilst giving you some additional movement and protection against those nefarious 2-shotting Genjis, oh how I hate you. If you\u2019re getting hard targeted, are still learning how to position, or are just having an off day, this can help.\n\n![Image](https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/606007873880719382/1405810902594490541/image.png?ex=68a02eed&is=689edd6d&hm=eddcd3558fb2c6b546e68217e47dd82d25004b309040844f5498a86c250fc2a2&=&format=webp&quality=lossless \"large\")\n\nCore Build\n\nAmari\u2019s Antidote - The lifesaver and core of your build. Get it.\n\nBooster Jets - The best Attack Speed Item you can buy. Get it.\n\nEye of the Spider - A big stat stick. Get it.\n\nChain Evoker - Helps with survivability and buffs blue beam. A Mercy must-have.\n\nI\u2019m Getting Wrecked Items\n\nBlessed Boosters - Take this to try and escape and position more unpredictably to avoid death.\n\nOverdrive Core - You will constantly be healing yourself so the real danger for you is getting one/two shot. Overdrive Core will help with that and still gives you some Weapon Power.\n\nI DO NOT Recommend:\n\nX Angelic Acrobats - Blessed Boosters is a better item with additional health and better mobility. I\u2019d take it over Angelic acrobats any day.\n\nX Cushioned Padding - Maybe when Brigitte gets added we\u2019ll need to consider this, but for now you should not be getting hit by Ana Sleep or Nades and that is the only real reason to take this.\n\nX Vanadium Injection - You\u2019re only getting 50 HP from this item because you should be using Valkyrie on Cooldown. Please stop taking this item, I don\u2019t know why I see this used so much.\n\n\nOption 3: I am a god who will never die.\n\nNothing makes me happier than Glass Cannon Mercy, big damage, big heals, and in return, enormous damage boost. I have reached insane healing numbers with this build and nothing makes me happier than healing a 1000 hp Reinhardt to full in three seconds. This build offers no safety or protection and isn\u2019t feasible in all games, though this build should always be the goal to try and reach.\n\n![Image](https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/606007873880719382/1405811004323004508/image.png?ex=68a02f06&is=689edd86&hm=8bbd443403e43ed9e9bf912eff722c4b099389133fd45916c4d578a9ca61e196&=&format=webp&quality=lossless \"large\")\n\nCore Build\n\nAmari\u2019s Antidote - The lifesaver and core of your build. Get it.\n\nBooster Jets - The best Attack Speed Item you can buy. Get it.\n\nEye of the Spider - A big stat stick. Get it.\n\nChain Evoker - Helps with survivability and buffs blue beam. A Mercy must-have.\n\nHardlight Accelerator - Adds a new multiplier to your healing. (70 HPS) Get it.\n\nThe Closer - MOAR POWER!!!\n\nGlass Cannon Items\n\nThe Closer - Buy this if you can afford it, it\u2019s the best stack stick.\n\nAdvanced Nanobiotics - This offers the same amount of HPS as The Closer does, but you don\u2019t get the additional Critical Damage for Valkyrie.\n\nCodebreaker - I buy this item for one reason, and one reason alone - to kill Orisa.",
